    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the help. i'm just worried about the tetanus thing because it was pretty dirty tool. i think i had a shot years ago but cant remember when. if i just scrub it really well and use that peroxide you mentioned, that should be enough to kill any bacteria that got in there right? i'm kinda broke so i'd really rather not spend money on an urgent care visit if i don't have to.",
